      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Approach 1\n\n\nTwo type of approaches are very apparent in the following question\n1. Use of Sorting + Binary Search \nIn this approach we can find target-index[i] if it exists or not \nBinary search approach is useful cause there is exactly only one solution to \nthe given problem set \n\nThis Method requires applying BS multiple Times so repetition of the total time \ncomplexity of NLOGN*M => till a solution has not been found \n\n",
      "fontSize": 17.624876799730398,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Approach 1\n\n\nTwo type of approaches are very apparent in the following question\n1. Use of Sorting + Binary Search \nIn this approach we can find target-index[i] if it exists or not \nBinary search approach is useful cause there is exactly only one solution to \nthe given problem set \n\nThis Method requires applying BS multiple Times so repetition of the total time \ncomplexity of NLOGN*M => till a solution has not been found \n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
